## Features
- Santa sways and sings festively;
- Sensors activate with a clap;
- Classic red outfit with gifts;
- Bendable arms for custom poses;
- Cord-free battery-powered setup;

## Information
Looking to give your indoor decor a neighborhood-stopping holiday statement? This life-size HOMCOM Santa Claus figure turns any room into an engaging festive display. Activated by touch or sound, he sways his body and sings cheerful Christmas music. Dressed in a red velvet fabric suit, Santa Claus holds two wrapped gift boxes in hand and carries a candy cane. Thanks to flexible wire arms, you can adjust his posture for dynamic holiday displays or welcoming poses that bring seasonal cheer.
